# IMP-15 (IR-002) the new app starting over the shipped app's saved entries: the migration and the native names
# commit: 930477c533 (its tree; run just before that commit was made)
# env: macOS 26.5.2, Xcode 26; my iPhone 17 Pro Max simulator, iOS 26.1; no node (the addresses do not answer)
# date: 2026-11-19 (22:39-22:44 local)

Steps
1. Installed the new build (Debug, unsigned) and launched it once (a fresh install: no entries; the migration only marks itself done).
2. Reset its group defaults to the shipped app's state with the simulator's own `defaults` (through cfprefsd):
   removed the marker `autobyteus.migrations.saved-node-display-name-placeholder`; wrote `autobyteus.saved-node-entries`
   as the shipped app's JSONEncoder output of two entries, and selected the first:
     {"id":"http://192.0.2.10:29695","displayName":"AutoByteus Desktop","host":"192.0.2.10","port":29695,...,"updatedAtEpochMilliseconds":3}
     {"id":"https://desk.example.invalid","displayName":"Test Node 279","host":"desk.example.invalid",...,"updatedAtEpochMilliseconds":2}
3. Launched the app (it opens the selected computer at start), screenshot after ~10 s; read the defaults back.
4. A throwaway UI test (not committed) tapped Back to nodes, captured the start screen and the first row's Remove sheet,
   and printed the rows' accessibility labels.
5. Launched once more and read the defaults back.

Results
- After step 3: marker = done; entries read back (sorted keys, the migration's rewrite):
  [{"displayName":"192.0.2.10","host":"192.0.2.10",...},{"displayName":"Test Node 279","host":"desk.example.invalid",...}]
  i.e. the placeholder became the host; the pairing-link name was kept; every other field unchanged.
- Connecting / Can't reach for the selected computer: "Can’t reach AutoByteus node" (IMP-15-1-cant-reach.png).
- Start screen (step 4): ROWS: ["AutoByteus node, Not reachable", "Test Node 279, Not reachable"]
                         MORE: ["More for AutoByteus node", "More for Test Node 279"]   (IMP-15-2-your-nodes.png)
- Remove sheet: title "AutoByteus node", "Remove AutoByteus node from this phone? ..." (IMP-15-3-remove-sheet.png).
- After step 5: 0 backup keys (`...:before-display-name-placeholder` removed by a later start); marker done.
